# Timestamped pre-edit backup copies some editing tools leave behind
# (e.g. chat.js.before-close-20261108-042906, _two-domain-batch-20261109-223641/).
# These have no reason to be committed; the real history is git's.
*.before-close-*
_*-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]/

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.bak
